# Story 67: Todo Lists (40s)
# Hook: Watch your agent break a big job into tracked, checkable steps.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-067-todo-lists.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Watch your agent break a big job into tracked, checkable steps.

[00:03.0 --> 00:08.0]
Start rysh and switch to prompt mode.

[00:08.0 --> 00:24.0]
Hand the agent a multi-step task. It uses the todo tool to add items, then marks each one complete as it goes.

[00:24.0 --> 00:34.0]
The list lives in per-pane JetStream KV. Add, update, complete, or remove items -- the agent tracks its own work.

[00:34.0 --> 00:40.0]
The todo tool keeps long, multi-step work organized and visible from start to finish.

